724 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 322 0 R
/T (Research Points are crucial, having your army spread while also expanding can allow you to succeed in gaining strong and powerful cards. March orders can allow you to scatter your units to nearby tiles. You can chain 2 March orders allowing you to have a bigger unit count on the front lines or during battle, both when Attacking or Defending. If you win a battle against a none-defense order, the Action Token for that player is wasted. +2 Research Points Tiles allows you to get a head start against others. When you lose a battle, you can occupy any empty territories nearby especially territories the enemy left to do such attack. Similarly, you can scatter your Units when you lose that battle to nearby tiles.)
/E (Research Points are crucial, having your army spread while also expanding can allow you to succeed in gaining strong and powerful cards. March orders can allow you to scatter your units to nearby tiles. You can chain 2 March orders allowing you to have a bigger unit count on the front lines or during battle, both when Attacking or Defending. If you win a battle against a none-defense order, the Action Token for that player is wasted. +2 Research Points Tiles allows you to get a head start against others. When you lose a battle, you can occupy any empty territories nearby especially territories the enemy left to do such attack. Similarly, you can scatter your Units when you lose that battle to nearby tiles.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
